    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "From [22, Section 3], for every θ, we have E[∥U(x,k∆t;θ) − Un(x,k∆t;θ)∥2] ≤ Kk∆t,U(·,0),θλ−N1+1(θ), (D.15)"
  }, {
